// Repro: moving to an empty `where`-set must resolve to the base location,
// not the location-0 sentinel (fixed 2026-08, D-11). Before the fix the
// destination evaluated to location index 0 ("First") and the card was
// mislaid there.
player P1
turnorder (P:P1)
location First on P:P1
location Second on P:P1
location Deck on table

card on Deck: Rank(Ace, Two) for Suit(Diamonds)

stage Play for current 1 times {
  move top(Deck) private to Second where Rank is "Ghost"
  end stage
}
